82:[L6] The order rays $(-\infty,\tfrac12)$ and $(\tfrac12,\infty)$ are open in the usual topology of $\mathbb R$ ([[lem-real-line-is-a-metric-space]], clause 3), so their traces $[0,\tfrac12)$ and $(\tfrac12,1]$ are open in the subspace topology of $[0,1]$ ([[def-subspace-topology-top]], [[def-interval]]). They are disjoint and contain $0$ and $1$, respectively.
